		本次健康评估采用连续14天的生态瞬时监测: 'This health assessment employs 14 consecutive days of ecological momentary assessment, aiming to capture the dynamic changes in your physiological and psychological states. Short-term single tests are prone to interference from random factors, while a two-week data tracking can more effectively eliminate temporary fluctuations and reveal underlying trends. Research indicates that 14 days is a key window for observing the stability of emotional and autonomic nervous system patterns, as it can cover the natural physiological cycle and identify persistent abnormal signals, providing a scientific basis for early warning.',
